bbcode_enabled = true
bbcode_text = "[center][b]Hi everyone, 
We are back with some more adjustments!
Have fun and see y’all soon :)

- Doro and Mario
[/b][/center]

o Added Alt tooltips for Unidentified Skill, Badges, Spirit Bells, 
   Anvil, Amulet of Feasting, Piggy of Riches, Speak with Animals, 
   Bag of Giving and Rainbow Potion.

[b]Balancing[/b]
[center][b]Neutral[/b][/center]
o Poison Dagger: Cooldown 2.1s -> 1.9s
o Bloody Dagger: Cooldown 2.3s -> 2.1s
o Spectral Dagger: Cooldown 2.7s -> 2.5s
o Boiling Pot: Heal 5 -> 8
o Ripsaw Blade: Cost 8g -> 7g
o Pine Protector: Heal 5 -> 6
o Corrupted Crystal (Inventory): Cooldown 4.1s -> 3.9s
o Girl Power: Speed bonus 25% -> 30%
o Blood Manipulation: Speed bonus 20% -> 25%
o Mana Mastery: Speed bonus 20% -> 25%
o Enchanted Weapons: Repeat chance 20% -> 22%
o Spicy Banana: Heat chance 50% -> 55%
o No Rush Please: Cold 4 -> 5
o Echoing Battlecry: Speed bonus 50% -> 55%
o Investment Opportunity: Maximum health 4 -> 5
o Smithing for Dummies: Stamina reduction 25% -> 30%
o Uniquely Unique: Unique chance 50% -> 60%
o Knife to Meet You: Triggers faster per dagger 40% -> 50%
o Heavy Drinking: Speed per potion 80% -> 90%
o Power of the Moon: Maximum health 65% -> 70%
o Double Rainbow: Speed bonus 30% -> 35%
o Fortuna’s Kiss: Chance increase 30% -> 33%
o Bagtacular: Trigger speed 5% -> 7%, stamina regeneration 5% -> 7%
o Hardwood: Block 20 -> 22
o Stoned: Damage reduction 20% -> 22%
o Just Stats / More Stats: Maximum health 10% -> 12%

[center][b]Ranger[/b][/center]
o Wisp (Weapon): Damage threshold 25 -> 30
o Markswoman: Attack speed 35% -> 40%

[center][b]Reaper[/b][/center]
o Snake: Health per Pet 45 -> 40
o Jimbo: Random buffs 6 -> 7
o Doom Cap: Cooldown 3s -> 3.1s
o Frog Prince: Cooldown 3.5s -> 3.2s
o Heart of the Cards: Mana 5 -> 6
o Dark Ritual: Vampirism 10 -> 12

[center][b]Pyromancer[/b][/center]
o Turbo-Shelly: Cooldown 11s -> 11.5s
o Molten Greatsword: Fire item count 6 -> 8
o Blazing Spear: Fire item count 6 -> 7

[center][b]Berserker[/b][/center]
o Spiked Staff: Spikes 2 -> 3
o Panzer Dragon: Reflect 7 -> 8, bonus damage 5 -> 6
o Dragon Set: Cooldown 0.9s -> 0.8s

[center][b]Mage[/b][/center]
o Rainbow Potion: Random buffs 5 -> 6
o Badger Spirit Companion: Cooldown 4.7s -> 4.8s
o Cat Spirit Companion: Cooldown 3.2s -> 3s
o Cupcake: Cost 6g  -> 5g
o Chess Board: Cooldown 0.8s -> 0.9s
